{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id448240288"}, "name":{"label":"ironsfabmom"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-14T11:03:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.1.72"}, "id":{"label":"14427697739"}, "title":{"label":"Truly useful; free"}, "content":{"label":"Our family of six all love music.  We listen to almost all genres.  We love to find undiscovered artists and play all the ole favorites.  This app is a rare find in that you can truly enjoy your music free of charge.  The ads are not frequent and if they truly bother you, you can, as my daughters combined,  and separately my son have, pay for premium, which is also reasonably priced.  We learn about each other even, by following suggestions and educate friends by introducing new artists. I love this app.  Even an old “fogey”… haha.. not, but seriously, a technologically challenged individual as myself, finds this app easy to use!   I create playlists and can play them at will.  Thank you for making music accessible in such an easy platform 💙❣️", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=324684580&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
