{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id454709551"}, "name":{"label":"— M —"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-14T10:01:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.1.72"}, "id":{"label":"14427499853"}, "title":{"label":"mildly annoyed"}, "content":{"label":"I have been a paying subscriber for many years due to my disdain for commercials. I also have a disdain for prompts to rate and review, but the real reason for 4 rather than 5 stars has been the frequency of changes to the app to nudge behavior over the years. Maybe it’s my old phone, but things are slower and not always stable. I wish several things were implemented differently, but the biggest irritation of late is that new podcast episodes are not displayed…at least not until I mark one as done that I’m not going listen to anyway. One too many workarounds I’ve had to figure out for myself in order to hear what I want in the order I want. — M —", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=324684580&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
